          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “take a wooden stick and write on it the words, ‘The kingdom of Judah’. Then take another stick and write on it the words, ‘The kingdom of Israel’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then hold the two sticks end to end in your hand so that they look like one stick. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When your people ask you to tell them what this means, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tell them that I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am going to take the stick representing Israel and put it with the one that represents Judah. Out of the two I will make one stick and hold it in my hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hold in your hand the two sticks and let the people see them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then tell them that I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am going to take all my people out of the nations where they have gone, gather them together, and bring them back to their own land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will unite them into one nation in the land, on the mountains of Israel. They will have one king to rule over them, and they will no longer be divided into two nations or split into two kingdoms. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will not defile themselves with disgusting idols any more or corrupt themselves with sin. I will free them from all the ways in which they sin and betray me. I will purify them; they will be my people, and I will be their God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 34.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A king like my servant David will be their king. They will all be united under one ruler and will obey my laws faithfully. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will live on the land I gave to my servant Jacob, the land where their ancestors lived. They will live there for ever, and so will their children and all their descendants. A king like my servant David will rule over them for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make a covenant with them that guarantees their security for ever. I will establish them and increase their population, and put my Temple in their land, where it will stay for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 6.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 21.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will live there with them; I will be their God, and they will be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I place my Temple there to be among them for ever, then the nations will know that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have chosen Israel to be my own people.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
